# ${SRC_DIR}/hooks/

Cross-feature hooks for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Hooks used by exactly one feature belong in `features/<name>/hooks/` instead — only promote to here once a second consumer appears.

## Naming

- Always start with `use`: `useDebouncedValue.ts`, `useIsMobile.ts`.
- One hook per file.

